      "data": {"identity": {"graphId": "topic-template"}, "content": {"kind": "markdown", "value": "## Understand a subject\n\n**Topic → concepts → claims/mechanisms/perspectives → sources → synthesis**\n\nExpand detail only where the subject demands it."}}
